WEBVTT

1
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:11,110
Must go

2
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,550
He hates me so much

3
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:32,890
He won't let me go wherever I go.

4
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:34,050
If you don’t leave, get off the car

5
00:00:34,590 --> 00:00:36,710
I have to catch up with the next business. Sorry.

6
00:00:36,910 --> 00:00:38,740
I haven't decided where to go yet

7
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:40,630
Stopped my car without thinking

8
00:00:41,030 --> 00:00:42,190
You must be playing tricks on me on purpose

9
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:43,870
What did your parents teach you?

10
00:00:43,870 --> 00:00:46,110
There is no moral sense at all.

11
00:00:46,430 --> 00:00:48,760
Get out of the car now and mix the gas

12
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,740
I'm sorry why I met an unlucky guy like you today.

13
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:54,380
I'll get off now

14
00:00:57,650 --> 00:00:58,570
Are you crazy?

15
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:01,100
I just opened the door and was unlucky

16
00:01:01,420 --> 00:01:05,540
Why did you meet a crazy woman today? Come on, touch her. Come on.

17
00:01:06,210 --> 00:01:07,450
You're not wearing a skirt, are you?
